OL,3,ASeven in hospital after car 'mounts
OL,4,Apavement' in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people have been taken to
OL,7,Fhospital after they were struck by a
OL,8,Fcar in the west end of Glasgow.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland said the driver was
OL,11,Fassessed by paramedics and treated at
OL,12,Fthe scene of the incident, which
OL,13,Fhappened at about 15:45 on Hyndland
OL,14,FRoad.
OL,16,FUnconfirmed reports suggest the vehicle
OL,17,Fmounted the pavement, hit a bus stop
OL,18,Fshelter and then struck scaffolding
OL,19,Fbefore coming to a halt.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
