OL,3,ASeven in hospital after car 'mounts
OL,4,Apavement' in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA force spokesperson said: "Officers
OL,7,Fremain in attendance and inquiries are
OL,8,Fongoing into the incident which is
OL,9,Fbeing treated as a road traffic
OL,10,Fcollision."
